    wm_quality_contract_glass_dark_contrast_reads_dead_palette_2026-11-26, 0, "glass_dark aliases to aetheric_dark, so generate_css's glass_dark palette branch is dead and the page CSS declares --ui-bg twice (#1e1e2e first, aetheric package #0e0e10 last, which wins); wm_theme_quality_report reads the first declaration and reports contrast 998 against a 1700..1900 spec band."

